      "short": "\\$969.50",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Hours per day} &= 35\\div5=7\\\\\\text{Normal pay} &= 26.30\\times7\\times5=\\$920.50\\\\\\text{Allowance} &= 9.80\\times5=\\$49.00\\\\\\text{Total pay} &= 920.50+49.00=\\$969.50\\end{align*}$$",
